  "description": "Generic Repository Pattern implementation for Entity Framework Core with support for filters, pagination, Unit of Work pattern with transaction management, Include (Eager Loading) for related entities, and multiple primary key types (Guid and Int).",
  "id": "CVAMF.Repository",
